            "action_name": {
              "value": "Take Root"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(necromancy, primal)\n\nRequirements: The Blood-Pear Tree has a creature grabbed or restrained\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe Blood-Pear Tree buries its roots into the creature, dealing 2d6+17 piercing damage (DC 38 basic Fortitude save). On a failure, the creature is enfeebled 1 (or increases the value by 1 if already enfeebled), and the corpseroot regains 15 HP. If this would make a creature enfeebled 5, the creature dies."
